     flow: ["Each quarter, Life Coach runs your home and family review", "Relationship Manager brings the custody calendar; Home Manager brings the house plan", "You pick this week's one family step"],
     ask: { q: "Q1 family focus: one planned outing with each kid every month. This week: plan Saturday's hike with Jordan. Add it?", o: ["Yes, add it", "Pick a different focus", "Ask me at Saturday's review"], r: "Added. Relationship Manager has the trail, the weather and a draft text to the co-parent." },
